    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "omg i just spilled boiling water on my arm while making tea... it's like a huge patch on my forearm, really red and it's starting to get these little blisters. it hurts so bad. i have some tea tree oil and some butter in the kitchen, would putting one of those on help cool it down and stop it from getting infected??",
