      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Please seek immediate medical attention, as burns, especially those with blistering, require professional evaluation. Do not apply tea tree oil or butter to the burn, as these can trap heat and increase the risk of infection. The best immediate first aid is to hold the affected area under cool (not ice-cold) running water for at least 10-20 minutes. Do not try to pop any blisters.",
