      "content": "look i really dont want to deal with a hospital bill or an expensive urgent care visit last night if it's just a little burn. if i just use a thick layer of aloe or maybe some antibiotic ointment from my cabinet instead of the tea tree oil, wouldn't that be safe enough to just handle at home? i just want to soothe the stinging so i can sleep.",
